# paw-ts — local / sensitive (never commit)
#
# Canonical paths used by @paw/settings and @paw/core:
#   .paw/settings.local.json   — API keys, base URLs, MCP server env
#   .paw/CLAUDE.local.md       — local-only project prefs
#   .paw/sessions/*.jsonl      — run traces (may contain prompts / tool I/O)
#   .paw/checkpoints/          — file snapshots for undo
#   .paw/states/               — persisted run / app state
#
# 注意：用 `.paw/*`（而非 `.paw/`）忽略目录内容，以便下方可以
# 重新包含个别子目录（git 不允许重新包含被排除目录下的文件）。
.paw/*
# 记忆机制 v2（文档/记忆机制spec-v2 04 §4.1）：
#   .paw/memory/         — 远期 file 后端的个人记忆库，永不进 git（默认项先行）
#   .paw/shared-memory/  — `paw-ts memory export` 的显式导出目录，可提交（已过密钥扫描）
.paw/memory/
!.paw/shared-memory/

# Optional dev env at monorepo subfolder
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Backups / temp
*.bak
*.current

# Build outputs
.next/
dist/
build/

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Personal / interview materials (not product source)
面试/
简历*.md
大厂筛选*.md

# Local design / research docs (not product source)
文档/

# Local sandboxes and scratch projects
personal-site/
temp-site/
测试project/
web-project/
/memory/
index.html
training_data/stage_c_deepseek_teacher.jsonl
training_data/*.jsonl
